      "content": "hey i've been tracking something weird and i need help looking at the data. lately whenever there's a major shift in the sp500 or btc there's this specific physical sensation i get. like a sharp pressure in my inner ear or a certain kind of tightness in my chest right before the volatility hits. \n\ntoday at 10:14am est i got this really intense ringing in my left ear and 2 minutes later the tech sector just tanked. i want to see if there's a pattern here. can you help me cross-reference my sensation logs with market volatility timestamps to see if these somatic signals actually precede the price action?",
