      "content": "thanks. i'll definitely keep a more detailed log. the medical thing is fine, i've already been, it's just that the timing is what's driving me crazy. like it's too precise to be anything else.\n\ni've been looking back at some notes from last week. on tuesday around 2:30pm i had this weird vibrating feeling in my palms, and right after that the btc volume spiked and the price swung like 3% in minutes. and then again yesterday morning, a sudden headache right before the market open volatility.\n\ncan we try something more specific? instead of just general volatility, can you look at the 1-minute candle data for btc and the sp500 for yesterday? i want to see if the specific minute my \"signals\" happen actually lines up with the shifts in order flow or volume spikes. like, can we test if my body is picking up on these macro shifts before they show up in the price?",
